    "Each iPhone or iPad pairs once: over the USB cable by itself, or on Wi‑Fi with a code this Mac shows when the device asks. Everything devices send and receive is encrypted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each iPhone or iPad pairs once: over the USB cable by itself, or on Wi‑Fi with a code this Mac shows when the device asks. Everything devices send and receive is encrypted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每台 iPhone 或 iPad 只需配对一次：连接 USB 线缆即可自动配对，或在 Wi‑Fi 下输入设备请求时这台 Mac 显示的配对码。设备收发的所有数据都会加密。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每部 iPhone 或 iPad 只需配對一次：接上 USB 連接線即可自動配對，或在 Wi‑Fi 下輸入裝置提出要求時這部 Mac 顯示的配對碼。裝置收發的所有資料都會加密。"
