    },
    "Sill couldn’t use its key in your keychain. Quit Sill and open it again, and choose Always Allow if the keychain asks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill couldn’t use its key in your keychain. Quit Sill and open it again, and choose Always Allow if the keychain asks."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 未能使用钥匙串中的密钥。请退出并重新打开 Sill；若钥匙串弹出询问，请选择“始终允许”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 無法使用鑰匙圈中的金鑰。請結束並重新開啟 Sill；若鑰匙圈詢問，請選擇「永遠允許」。"
